Package: FibrTraQ
Type: Package
Title: Voxel-Resolved Focal-ROI Target Profiling of Diffusion Tractograms
Version: 0.3.4
Authors@R: c(
    person("Chase", "Stratton", , "cstratton@desu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Nicholas", "Cottam", role = "aut")
  )
Author: Chase Stratton [aut, cre], Nicholas Cottam [aut]
Description: Computes voxel-resolved association profiles between a focal brain
    region and target regions from diffusion magnetic resonance imaging
    tractography. Reads 'TrackVis' ('.trk') and 'MRtrix' ('.tck') tractograms
    with 'NIfTI' masks and checks spatial compatibility before counting.
    Supports full-streamline and endpoint-based target assignment, focal-voxel
    coverage summaries, endpoint quality control, and export of tables,
    density maps, self-contained reports, and an interactive three-dimensional
    viewer. Counts are unweighted; interpretation requires independently
    verified spatial alignment and biologically plausible tractography.
